'''''Osteobrama bhimensis''''' is a species of [[ray-finned fish]] in the genus ''[[Osteobrama]]''. ''Osteobrama bhimensis'' is a [[Synonym (taxonomy)|synonym]] of ''[[Osteobrama vigorsii]]''<ref>{{cite journal|title=''Osteobrama bhimensis'' (Cypriniformes: Cyprinidae): a junior synonym of ''O. vigorsii''|date=September 2011|journal=Journal of Threatened Taxa |volume=3|issue=9|page=2078-2084|doi=10.11609/JoTT.o2841.2078-84|author= Shrikant Jadhav|author2=Mandar S Paingankar|author3=Neelesh Dahanukar|name-list-style=amp|doi-access=free}}</ref> but valid on its own according to [[Fishbase]].<ref>{{Fishbase|Osteobrama|bhimensis|month=March|year=2024}}</ref>

